---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import Section from '../components/Section.astro';
import Button from '../components/Button.astro';
import CardGroup from '../components/CardGroup.astro';
import Card from '../components/Card.astro';

// Copy: rewritten from content-source/waypoint-content-v1.md, section "8 Placement arrangements
// and fees". Both prices are PROPOSED launch figures: no bookings, no tax claim, and never the
// possible future £125 offer. Replace provisional wording once the commercial terms are final.
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Fees and placement arrangements"
  description="Proposed prices and arrangements for school-funded and home education places at Waypoint in Shoreham-by-Sea."
>
  <PageHero title="Fees and placement arrangements" strapline="How school-funded and home education places are arranged." />

  <Section
    id="fees"
    title="Fees"
    strapline="Clear costs, agreed before anyone starts."
    drawing="report"
    drawingLabel="Line drawing of a report sheet with ticks and a pencil"
  >
    <Fragment slot="intro">
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          We agree the purpose, dates, support and costs before a young person starts. The prices below are proposed
          launch prices, and the final terms and availability are confirmed before any place is agreed.
        </p>
      </div>
    </Fragment>
    <CardGroup columns={2}>
      <Card title="School-funded places" icon="clipboard">
        <strong>£100</strong> per young person per day. Proposed launch price.
        <a href="#school-funded-places">What's included</a>
      </Card>
      <Card title="Home education places" icon="people">
        <strong>£85</strong> per young person per day. Proposed launch price.
        <a href="#home-education-places">What's included</a>
      </Card>
    </CardGroup>
  </Section>

  <Section
    id="school-funded-places"
    title="School-funded places"
    strapline="What's included, and how booking works."
    drawing="school"
    drawingLabel="Line drawing of a school building with a clock and a flag"
    drawingSide="left"
  >
    <Fragment slot="intro">
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          The proposed price is £100 per young person per day. It includes the small-group programme, individual goals,
          support within the group, a weekly report and fuller reviews at agreed points.
        </p>
        <p>
          One-to-one support or extra staffing isn't included automatically. If it's needed, we talk through what's
          involved and what it costs before offering a place.
        </p>
      </div>
    </Fragment>
    <div class="prose more">
      <h3>Booking</h3>
      <p>
        Places are booked over twelve delivery weeks. The written offer lists the actual dates and review points, so the
        commitment is clear. A proposed place isn't a confirmed booking or start date.
      </p>
      <h3>Absence</h3>
      <p>
        The fee reserves the young person's place in the group, so booked sessions are still charged if they're absent,
        under the agreed terms. Please tell us about absence as soon as you can, using the contacts you were given.
      </p>
      <h3>Invoicing</h3>
      <p>
        We plan to invoice schools each half-term in advance. Before the start, we agree the finance contact, any
        purchase order and the payment terms, and plan invoice dates around finance office closures such as Easter and
        summer.
      </p>
      <h3>Ending a placement early</h3>
      <p>
        We need written notice. Our proposed arrangement is payment to the end of the current half-term, or for at least
        two further chargeable weeks, whichever is later. The final terms set out the exact dates and are agreed before
        booking.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="button-row">
      <Button href="/how-referrals-work/#school-funded-places">How referrals work</Button>
      <Button href="/contact/?purpose=placement" variant="secondary">Ask a question</Button>
    </div>
  </Section>

  <Section
    id="home-education-places"
    title="Home education places"
    strapline="Terms agreed before any booking."
    drawing="campfire"
    drawingLabel="Line drawing of stick people sitting and standing round a campfire"
  >
    <Fragment slot="intro">
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          The proposed price is £85 per young person per day, for practical projects and shared learning alongside other
          young people. We talk through support needs and whether the group suits your child before anything is booked.
        </p>
        <p>
          Before bookings open, we'll set out the commitment, payment and cancellation terms, how we'll keep you updated
          and whether parents stay. The school-funded terms above don't apply, and we're not taking bookings yet.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="button-row">
        <Button href="/home-education/">Home education at Waypoint</Button>
        <Button href="/contact/?purpose=home-education" variant="secondary">Ask a question</Button>
      </div>
    </Fragment>
  </Section>

  <Section
    id="before-you-book"
    title="Before you book"
    strapline="Everything in writing first."
    drawing="setting"
    drawingLabel="Line drawing of a building with a tree and the sun"
    drawingSide="left"
  >
    <Fragment slot="intro">
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          Before you accept a place, we'll tell you where to come, the booked dates and times, who handles transport and
          handover, and what to bring, including clothing, equipment, food and drink. You'll also have a contact for any
          questions. Please mention any access, health or support needs when we talk about the placement.
        </p>
        <p>
          The written offer sets out the total cost, what's included, any agreed extra charges and what happens if
          Waypoint has to cancel a session.
        </p>
      </div>
    </Fragment>
  </Section>

  <Section
    id="ask-about-costs"
    title="Ask about costs"
    strapline="We'll explain what's still being confirmed."
    brand
    drawing="chat"
    drawingLabel="Line drawing of two stick people chatting, with speech bubbles"
  >
    <Fragment slot="intro">
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          Schools can ask about school-funded places, and home-educating families can ask about home education places.
          We'll explain the proposed prices and which costs or terms are still being confirmed. Asking doesn't reserve a
          place.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="button-row">
        <Button href="/contact/" variant="accent">Ask a question</Button>
      </div>
    </Fragment>
  </Section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .more {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .more h3 {
    margin-top: 1.75rem;
  }

  .more h3:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }
</style>
